        * :py:obj:`~.hipError_t`: py:obj:`~.hipSuccess`, :py:obj:`~.hipErrorInvalidValue`, :py:obj:`~.hipErrorNotSupported`, :py:obj:`~.hipErrorOutOfMemory`
